Title: Ethan Nwaneri: Arsenal set to formally offer new deal to teenage forward
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Arsenal are set to make teenage forward Ethan Nwaneri a formal offer of a new contract.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 72}}, {'Description': 'Talks over fresh terms are set to accelerate in the coming days amid a will from all parties to reach an agreement.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 103}}, {'Description': 'BBC Sport understands the offer will be a new five-year deal, or four with the option of a further year.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 98}}, {'Description': 'While there has not been a definitive breakthrough, there is growing hope a deal can be reached with negotiations reaching an advanced stage.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 131}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Ethan Nwaneri'}]}
